      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Of 235 patients receiving Deladumone OB, more than 39 per cent complained of breast pain or swelling; 83 per cent were pleased with the medication. Of 215 patients receiving a placebo, more than 82 per cent complained of breast pain or swelling; 67.5 per cent were pleased with the medication."},
